# Vigil mode: the big clock, the tracked quest, the focus timer and a shooting star.
Output docs/images/vigil.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.2s
Type "f"
Sleep 2.6s
Show

Type "z"
Sleep 5s
Sleep 4.5s
